  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When an opponent targets the rockstar of at least 2nd level with a melee or ranged attack, the rockstar can spend an immediate action to make a Perform check. The rockstar can use the result as his AC or touch AC against the targeted attack. The rockstar must be aware of the attack and not flat-footed. The rockstar must be wielding an instrument to perform this ability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-rockstar#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
